      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STILL SHADY (2) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and four placings from nine starts. Below best last time at Wentworth Park (30.52) in a Grade 5, finishing a 11 length sixth. Looks suited here and rates on top. JET WATERS (4) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Maiden three back before a placing at this track the following run. Expecting significant improvement. SKEDADDLE LULU (7) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 365m behind Ashby Mocha (21.09) in a Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to her credit. A big run wouldn't surprise. ANY MORE CARAMEL (5) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
